# Map selection, opened over the skirmish screen by Select Map. A centred panel: title, the System/User maps switch as a
# segmented control, the map list, Accept and Cancel. The start-position markers are placed by code on the skirmish
# screen's map preview and stay where that puts them. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080; the panel is 900 x 640 centred
# (left 510, top 220).
hide $WinGadgetBorder
panel left top 510 220 900 640
window text:GUI:SelectAMapLowerCase left top 534 240 500 32 section
rule left top 534 280 852
window $RadioButtonSystemMaps left top 534 300 220 40 radio
window $RadioButtonUserMaps left top 758 300 220 40 radio
window $ListboxMap left top 534 356 852 400 list
window $ButtonBack left top 534 792 180 44 button
window $ButtonOK left top 1186 792 200 44 primary
